cellSaveData: implement cellSaveDataUserListAutoSave (NID 0x0E091C36).

The save-side twin of cellSaveDataUserListAutoLoad (0001-user-list-auto-load): same ten arguments, funcFixed picks the directory
and the stat/file callbacks write it. Resistance 3 saves campaign progress and settings through it; unresolved, nothing
was saved.

Upstream: not proposed yet.
